lass=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/products/loans\">ऋण<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/services\">सेवाहरू<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/rates\">ब्याज दर<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/publications\">प्रकाशनहरू<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/contact\">सम्पर्क</a></div></nav><button class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 lg:hidden\" aria-label=\"Menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-6 w-6\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><div><section class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-800 to-primary-900 px-4 py-16 text-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl\"><h1 class=\"mb-4 text-4xl font-bold\">कोशेढुङ्गाहरू</h1><p class=\"max-w-3xl text-lg text-primary-100\">हाम्रो यात्राका प्रमुख कोशेढुङ्गा र उपलब्धिहरू</p></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute left-6 top-0 h-full w-0.5 bg-primary-200\"></div><div class=\"space-y-10\"><div class=\"relative pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-3.5 top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-primary-700 bg-white\"><div class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary-700\"></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\"><span class=\"mb-1 inline-block rounded-full bg-primary-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-800\">२००१</span><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">कम्पनी स्थापना</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">रिलायन्स फाइनान्स लिमिटेड कम्पनी ऐन अन्तर्गत सार्वजनिक लिमिटेड कम्पनीको रूपमा स्थापित भयो।</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-3.5 top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-primary-700 bg-white\"><div class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary-700\"></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\"><span class=\"mb-1 inline-block rounded-full bg-primary-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-800\">२००२</span><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">NRB इजाजतपत्र</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकबाट वर्ग &#x27;ग&#x27; वित्तीय कम्पनीको रूपमा सञ्चालन इजाजतपत्र प्राप्त।</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-3.5 top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-primary-700 bg-white\"><div class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary-700\"></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\"><span class=\"mb-1 inline-block rounded-full bg-primary-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-800\">२००३</span><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">पहिलो शाखा उद्घाटन</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">कमलादी, काठमाडौंमा पहिलो शाखा कार्यालय खोली बैंकिङ सञ्चालन सुरू गरियो।</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-3.5 top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-primary-700 bg-white\"><div class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary-700\"></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\"><span class=\"mb-1 inline-block rounded-full bg-primary-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-800\">२००५</span><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">सञ्जाल विस्तार</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">नयाँ सडक र पोखरामा नयाँ शाखाहरू सहित सञ्चालन विस्तार।</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-3.5 top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-primary-700 bg-white\"><div class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary-700\"></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\"><span class=\"mb-1 inline-block rounded-full bg-primary-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-800\">२००८</span><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">डिजिटल बैंकिङ सुरूवात</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">एसएमएस बैंकिङ र अनलाइन खाता पहुँच सहित डिजिटल बैंकिङ सेवाहरूको सुरूवात।</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-3.5 top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-primary-700 bg-white\"><div class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary-700\"></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\"><span class=\"mb-1 inline-block rounded-full bg-primary-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-800\">२०१०</span><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">पुँजी वृद्धि</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">NRB को संशोधित न्यूनतम पुँजी आवश्यकता पूरा गर्न चुक्ता पुँजी वृद्धि।</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-3.5 top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-primary-700 bg-white\"><div class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary-700\"></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\"><span class=\"mb-1 inline-block rounded-full bg-primary-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-800\">२०१३</span><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">उत्पादन विविधीकरण</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">घर ऋण, शिक्षा ऋण र हायर पर्चेज योजनाहरू सहित नयाँ ऋण उत्पादनहरूको सुरूवात।</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-3.5 top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-primary-700 bg-white\"><div class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary-700\"></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\"><span class=\"mb-1 inline-block rounded-full bg-primary-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-800\">२०१५</span><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">विपद् पुनरुत्थान</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">२०७२ को भूकम्प पछि द्रुत रूपमा सञ्चालन पुनः सुरू गरी समुदायको राहत प्रयासहरूमा सहयोग।</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-3.5 top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-primary-700 bg-white\"><div class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary-700\"></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\"><span class=\"mb-1 inline-block rounded-full bg-primary-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-800\">२०१८</span><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">कोर बैंकिङ स्तरोन्नति</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">सुधारिएको दक्षता र ग्राहक सेवाको लागि आधुनिक कोर बैंकिङ प्रणालीको कार्यान्वयन।</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-3.5 top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-primary-700 bg-white\"><div class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary-700\"></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\"><span class=\"mb-1 inline-block rounded-full bg-primary-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-800\">२०२०</span><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">डिजिटल प्रवेग</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">महामारीको प्रतिक्रियामा डिजिटल रूपान्तरणलाई गति दिँदै, परिष्कृत मोबाइल बैंकिङ सेवाहरू सुरूवात।</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-3.5 top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-primary-700 bg-white\"><div class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary-700\"></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\"><span class=\"mb-1 inline-block rounded-full bg-primary-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-800\">२०२२</span><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">पुँजी कोशेढुङ्गा</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">महत्वपूर्ण पुँजी वृद्धि हासिल गर्दै, कम्पनीको वित्तीय शक्तिलाई सुदृढ पारियो।</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-3.5 top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-primary-700 bg-white\"><div class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary-700\"></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\"><span class=\"mb-1 inline-block rounded-full bg-primary-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-800\">२०२४</span><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">रणनीतिक वृद्धि</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">निरन्तर शाखा विस्तार र उत्पादन नवाचार, नेपालको वित्तीय क्षेत्रमा बजार स्थिति सुदृढीकरण।</p></div></div></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-[#111827] text-gray-400\"><div class=\"container-page py-12\"><div class=\"grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6\"><div><h3 class=\"mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white\">प्रतिवेदन</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2.5\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/publications/reports/annual-report\">वार्षिक प्रतिवेदन</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/publications/reports/quarterly-reports\">त्रैमासिक प्रतिवेदन</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/publications/reports/agm-minute\">AGM मिनेट</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/publications/reports/basel-ii-disclosure\">बासेल II खुलासा</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 transit